											"name": "SCOPE_SINGLETON",
											"documentation": "Scope identifier for the standard singleton scope: \"singleton\".\nNote that extended bean factories might support further scopes.\n\n标准单例作用域的作用域标识符:\"singleton\"。\n注意，扩展的bean工厂可能支持更多的作用域。",
