											},
											"name": "SCOPE_PROTOTYPE",
											"documentation": "Scope identifier for the standard prototype scope: \"prototype\".\nNote that extended bean factories might support further scopes.\n\n标准原型作用域的范围标识符:“prototype”。\n注意，扩展的bean工厂可能支持更多的作用域。",
