									"documentation": "Spring AOP 中用于创建代理对象的核心类\n\n是 Spring AOP 的底层编程式 API，​不依赖 Spring IoC 容器，可直接通过代码配置代理对象。它通过 getProxy() 方法直接生成代理，适用于脱离 Spring 环境的场景\n\n\n\nProxyFactory proxyFactory = new ProxyFactory(new MyServiceImpl());\n\nproxyFactory.addAdvice(new MyAdvice());\n\nMyService proxy = (MyService) proxyFactory.getProxy();\n",
									"operations": [
										{
											"_type": "UMLOperation",
											"_id": "AAAAAAGW0v368l4wKeI=",
